    "peer_reviewed": "preprint",
    "problems": "For the relevant size comparisons, only 1B and 3B models are reported, without uncertainty estimates or a fitted scale-performance relation. TADA's training context lengths differ by size.",
    "rows_left_out": "No other results bear on a claim version: the remaining tables and analyses concern speech reconstruction, TTS quality, latency, or guidance/loss ablations rather than scaling-law behavior or downstream performance versus scale.",
